C:Assign T: RAM:
C:Wait 10 SECS
C:Echo "FUJINET WRITE PERSISTED" >DH0:df0-persist-source.txt
C:Dir DF0: >DH0:df0-dir.result
C:Echo "DIR RC=$RC" >DH0:df0-dir-rc.result
C:Type DF0:KNOWN.TXT >DH0:df0-type.result
C:Copy DH0:df0-persist-source.txt TO DF0:PERSIST.TXT
C:Echo "COPY RC=$RC" >DH0:df0-copy.result
C:Echo "E2E COMPLETE"
